			"Message": "chore(Project): Coordinate Element submodule updates across 5 components\n\nSynchronize Mountain, Sky, Wind, Grove, and Cocoon submodules with the following changes:\n\n**Bug Fixes & Improvements:**\n- Mountain: Fix vscode-file:// URI resolution for extension assets, handling absolute OS paths (Volumes, Users, Library) and serving files directly. Add NLS placeholder resolution to extension scanner for %key% placeholders in package.json. Downgrade benign 404s to info-level. Fix remaining PascalCase module references. Simplify user extension path to .land/extensions.\n- Sky: Rename data folder from .codeeditorland to .land in product.json to align with branding.\n- Wind: Remove legacy Telemetry helper files (withMetric.js, withSpan.js) and update index.js.\n- Grove: Commit new changes.\n- Cocoon: Commit new changes.\n\nThese fixes enable proper loading of extension-contributed icon themes, grammars, and localization while aligning the editor with the new .land branding.",
			"SHA": "f29a21b14d95e3eed0c2abaec168d136cb343d5f"
