			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Complete PascalCase naming migration for RPC modules\n\nRename all remaining snake_case module files to PascalCase throughout the RPC layer: commands.rs, configuration.rs, debug.rs, processes.rs, scm.rs, telemetry.rs, terminals.rs, types.rs, vine.rs, windows.rs, and workspace.rs. Also remove deprecated/unused service modules (CommandService, SecretStorageService, WindowService, WorkspaceService, Telemetry/Metrics, Telemetry/Spans) and update mod.rs to use explicit #[path] attributes.\n\nThis completes the PascalCase migration for the RPC subsystem, following the pattern established in previous commits for Environment, LanguageFeature, and other modules.",
